{"message":"I can help with the account change, closing your Light Blue Account, and finding the best savings option. Before I access or modify your accounts, please verify any 2 of these 4 details: date of birth, email address, phone number, or address on file.

For your goals, the Bluest Account currently offers premium checking benefits, including 2.25% APY on the checking balance, up to $50 per month in ATM-fee rebates, 10 complimentary domestic outgoing wires monthly, free incoming domestic wires, a dedicated personal banker, and no Rho-Bank foreign ATM fee. Its documented savings pairings are Silver Account (+0.45% APY boost) and Bronze Account (+0.70% APY boost). Savings APY also depends on the selected savings tier and any eligible card bonuses, so I’ll compare the available options after verification.

Please also confirm whether you want the $25,000 transferred into the new savings account immediately, and whether you prefer Bluest Account or another checking option."}
